(7049332, 1071139, 138253, '<td valign="top">Love this image, looks like a painting that i''d be proud to hang on my wall!<br/> <br/>**Edit**<br/>one of my 3 10''s in the challenge, I truly hope to see this do well, and should hope it also takes home some PH crowd honors as well!</td>', 'Love this image, looks like a painting that i''d be proud to hang on my wall! **Edit**one of my 3 10''s in the challenge, I truly hope to see this do well, and should hope it also takes home some PH crowd honors as well!', '2013-06-07 16:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7049334, 1071796, 138253, '<td valign="top">One of my 3 10''s in this challenge.<br/>Simple, elegant, not clearly in focus, yet brilliantly enticing. This looks more like hand-brushed art than a picture, and i mean that in a truly positive way. I would be proud to have this hang on my wall!</td>', 'One of my 3 10''s in this challenge.Simple, elegant, not clearly in focus, yet brilliantly enticing. This looks more like hand-brushed art than a picture, and i mean that in a truly positive way. I would be proud to have this hang on my wall!', '2013-06-07 16:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7049335, 1071875, 138253, '<td valign="top">spectacular! I truly love this image exactly as it is, this is what I was truly hoping to find in this challenge, an image where the beauty is found in the accidental, in the uniqueness, and you have truly done that.<br/>i''d almost say that it deserves to be said that "this image is for the birds!"<br/>**Edit** Just to add, this is one of 3 10''s that i gave out in the challenge, but truly i would push my vote to 11 if i could, my other 10''s deserve them in my opinion, this is just a different kind of lovely image. I hope this gets the recognition it deserves from voters.</td>', 'spectacular! I truly love this image exactly as it is, this is what I was truly hoping to find in this challenge, an image where the beauty is found in the accidental, in the uniqueness, and you have truly done that.i''d almost say that it deserves to be said that "this image is for the birds!"**Edit** Just to add, this is one of 3 10''s that i gave out in the challenge, but truly i would push my vote to 11 if i could, my other 10''s deserve them in my opinion, this is just a different kind of lovely image. I hope this gets the recognition it deserves from voters.', '2013-06-07 16:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
