(7051503, 1071889, 19825, '<td valign="top">Our shots are similar with the misty panes in focus and our subjects out of focus. And, our average scores were very similar. <br/> <br/>Looking at this and other images in your portfolio, you have such a lovely way with still lifes. This is a genre that largely remains a mystery to me. I can appreciate a good still life when you put it in front of me, but I struggle to figure out how to create one on my own. Thanks for the lesson. I''ll keep working on it.</td>', 'Our shots are similar with the misty panes in focus and our subjects out of focus. And, our average scores were very similar.  Looking at this and other images in your portfolio, you have such a lovely way with still lifes. This is a genre that largely remains a mystery to me. I can appreciate a good still life when you put it in front of me, but I struggle to figure out how to create one on my own. Thanks for the lesson. I''ll keep working on it.', '2013-06-12 10:49:50.000000', NULL, 0),
